## Code-Architektur

### Ordnerstruktur

```text
server/src/engine/     ← Match-Engine (HANDS-OFF)
src/sim/               Saison-Sim, Liga-Table, Schedule
src/development/       growth_engine.ts, breakouts.ts, aging.ts
src/youth/             intake_generator.ts, youth_sim.ts, academy.ts
src/scouting/          estimate_model.ts, scout_network.ts, events.ts
src/transfers/         market_value.ts, negotiations.ts
src/economy/           finance.ts, buildings.ts
src/persistence/       savegame.ts, sanitizer.ts, migrations/
src/ui/                screens/, components/
src/types/             player.ts, contracts.ts (PRD 07)
```

**Modul-Grenzen:** Segregated monolith — Import-Richtung und Client-first Engine
laut PRD 17 und `.cursor/rules/17-module-boundaries.mdc` (kein UI in `engine`,
kein Gameplay-Match-API in Produktion).

### Naming Conventions
- TypeScript Interfaces: PascalCase (Player, Attributes, Contract)
- Functions: camelCase (`calculateWeeklyGrowth`, `generateYouthPlayer`)
- Files: kebab-case (`growth-engine.ts`, `scout-network.ts`)
- JSON Files: snake_case (`growth_curves.json`, `scout_network.json`)
- Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE (`SOFT_CAP = 180`, `HARD_CAP = 199`)

### Testing Requirements
- Jede PRD-Formel benötigt Unit-Tests
- Beispiel: `growth_engine.test.ts` muss testen:
  - Soft Cap bei 180 (×0.3 Faktor)
  - Pace-Decay ab decline_start 25, Stamina ab 27 (PRD 02.2), als Wochenanteil des Jahreswerts
  - `mentor_ignition`: drive +0.25, einmalig, Clamp auf 1.6 (PRD 06.2, PRD 07.3)
  - Gaussian Noise Verteilung (σ korrekt, PRD 02.3)

